OL,3,GNEWSABoys held after stolen bike report
OL,4,Aprompts pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour boys have been arrested after a
OL,7,Freport of a stolen motorbike prompted a
OL,8,Fpolice pursuit.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said on Tuesday
OL,11,Fnight, it was reported the bike had
OL,12,Fbeen seen driving dangerously in the
OL,13,FAlfreton area.
OL,15,FOfficers attended and saw a number of
OL,16,Fpeople on four motorbikes in Long
OL,17,FMeadow Road, before they sped off. Two
OL,18,Fof the bikes were then seen again in
OL,19,FRodgers Lane and a pursuit followed.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
