OL,3,GNEWSABoys held after stolen bike report
OL,4,Aprompts pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the help of a police helicopter,
OL,7,Fofficers caught up with those two bikes
OL,8,Fin The Chine in South Normanton, and
OL,9,Fthe four boys - 12, 15, 16 and 17 -
OL,10,Fwere arrested.
